:"A freshman belonging to the Faculty of Education at R University."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She acts as a diligent student, but her overly serious attitude causes Akito to look at her with suspicion."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a vivacious and outspoken personality. Later on, she and Akito pursue a case together."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c93027"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/62/62978273de3318a5f83b3ca11ca77c8159786921dacac8530a2cfe8c321d42ad.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/38/38845e222ab279669381ce2431541787712666f8a7d7c94513b69d7f61e61f11.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c93030","characterName":"柊 由美","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c93030"},"originalCharacterName":"柊 由美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mysterious woman who seems to be involved with the incident that took place a month ago. She is a woman of few words and does not say much, even to Akito and the others. She's been in contact with Detective Shiraishi. Presumed to have some kind of ability...?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c93030"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ed/edcccd53d6db3243834bfaf6e65f1413d9f63982c3dcca5e9d71d7461b8df7c2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7b/7b1c78692c360d164538c0eeab92151ac723e366c0c38efe4531ed5170365ed8.webp","width":21